<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n113420" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χάρμα</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ατος</span>, τό, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χαίρω</span>): <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>I.</b> in concrete sense, <i>source of
				joy, delight,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χ. γενέσθαι</span> or <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔσσεσθαί τινι,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				17.636
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				23.342
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χ. φίλοις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Thgn.
					692
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χ. μεῖζον ἐλπίδος κλύειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Ag.</u>
					266
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				636.1
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μᾶζαν, ἣν . . Δηὼ βροτοῖσι χ.
					δωρεῖται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Antiph.
					1
				</span></i>
			; of victory in the games, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄπονον ἔλαβον χ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pi.
					<u>O.</u>
					10
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				11
			</span></i>).<i><span class="en">
				22
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καλλίνικον χ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>I.</u>
					5
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				4
			</span></i>). <i><span class="en">
				54
			</span></i>: freq. in pl., <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				6.185
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μὴ γείτοσι χάρματα γήμῃς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hes.
					<u>Op.</u>
					701
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Max.
				87
			</span></i> (sg.); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χάρματ᾽ Ἐρινύος, χάρματα
				θηρῶν,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Ph.</u>
				1503
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Supp.</u>
				282
			</span></i> (both lyr.); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χάρματ᾽ ἄλλοις
				ἔθηκεν, ἐμβαλεῖν χ. ἀνθρώποισι,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>O.</u>
				2.99
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				7.44
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀντιδιδόναι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Eu.</u>
					984
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>source of malignant joy,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				3.51
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				6.82
			</span></i>, al.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λυπρά, χάρματα δ᾽ ἐχθροῖς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Pers.</u>
					1034
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> in
			abstract sense, <i>joy, delight,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν δ᾽ ἅμα χ. καὶ ἄλγος ἕλε φρένα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					19.471
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>h.Cer.</u>
				371
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hes.
				<u>Sc.</u>
				400
			</span></i>.—Poet. and late Prose, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Mar.</u>
				46
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
